---
description: Mumzo canonical project rules (always applied)
alwaysApply: true
---

Follow the canonical rules in `AGENTS.md` at the repo root, and the detailed rule docs it links:
`docs/rules/code-rules.md` and `docs/rules/design-rules.md`.

Non-negotiables:
- No `any` (Biome errors on it). Kebab-case filenames (`my-component.tsx`).
- Domain-driven layout: `modules/<domain>/{api,components,data,index.ts}` + `core/` + `pages/`.
- Compose `@mumzo/ui` first; semantic tokens only (`bg-primary`), never raw hex.
- Tailwind: `gap-*` not `space-y-*`, `size-*` for equal dims, `cn()` for conditional classes,
  no array index keys, self-closing empty elements.
- Respect Biome (2-space, 80-col, double quotes, no unused imports). `bunx tsc --noEmit` must pass.
- Never hand-edit `routeTree.gen.ts`.
